.TH csaf_aggregator 1 "23 October 2026"
.SH NAME
csaf_aggregator \- build a CSAF aggregator from other providers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcsaf_aggregator\fP [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Collects the advisories of the providers named in its configuration file and writes out the directory tree of a CSAF aggregator or of a lister, including the aggregator metadata, the ROLIE feeds and the index files. It takes no arguments: the list of providers comes from the configuration file.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Application Options
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-streaming_rolie_parser\fR\fP
Use the streaming ROLIE feed parser (experimental)
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-client_timeout\fR \fIDURATION\fR\fP
DURATION for HTTP Client timeouts
.TP
\fB\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-time_range\fR \fIRANGE\fR\fP
RANGE of time from which advisories to download
.TP
\fB\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-interim\fR\fP
Perform an interim scan
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-version\fR\fP
Display version of the binary
.TP
\fB\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fITOML-FILE\fR\fP
Path to config TOML file
.SS Help Options
.TP
\fB\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR\fP
Show this help message
